# Cloudflare Pages builds this on Linux while it is edited on macOS, and the
# hashed asset names in dist/ come from hashing file contents — a CRLF checkout
# would produce different hashes, and a lockfile diff that never settles.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated by bun; never hand-edited, so keep it out of diffs and reviews.
bun.lock linguist-generated=true -diff
